---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ProductCase from '../../components/ProductCase.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
import { products } from '../../data/site';
export function getStaticPaths() { return products.map(product => ({ params: { slug: product.slug }, props: { product } })); }
const { product: p } = Astro.props;
---
<Layout title={p.name+' — The business case'} description={p.description}>
<section class="container page-hero product-detail-heading"><a href="/products/" class="back-link">← All products</a><span class="eyebrow">A PRODUCT BY VORTIQUEST / THE BUSINESS CASE</span><h1>{p.name}<span class="serif-period">.</span></h1></section>
<div class="container"><ProductCase product={p} detail/></div>
<section class="container section two-paths"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHEN IT’S THE RIGHT FIT</span><h2>Your platform.<br/><em>Your choice.</em></h2></div><p>We’ll assess fit, security, ownership, and upkeep with you.  If another solution fits better, we’ll explain why.</p></div><div class="path-grid"><article><span class="eyebrow">IMPLEMENT IT YOURSELF</span><h3>Take the hands-on route.</h3><p>Explore the source, review the license and setup instructions, and manage your own deployment. Your team takes responsibility for configuration, security, updates, and operation.</p>{p.repository ? <a class="text-link" href={p.repository}>View on GitHub ↗</a> : <span class="pending-link">GitHub repository · Add Link</span>}<p class="small-copy">Review the repository’s license and dependency notices for permitted use.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">LET US HANDLE IT</span><h3>Make room for your work.</h3><p>Ask about paid hosting and ongoing support. We’ll discuss your requirements, agree on the service scope, and provide a quote before work begins.</p><a class="text-link" href={'/contact/?product='+encodeURIComponent(p.name)}>Ask about hosting & support ↗</a><p class="small-copy">Hosting, maintenance, and support are paid services scoped to your needs.</p></article></div></section><CTA/>
</Layout>
